flowchart TB
  K["KiCad board + project rules"] --> I["Import and validate canonical board"]
  I --> P["Prepared geometry: edges, pads, keepouts, existing copper"]
  I --> T["Connectivity, same-net trees, terminal escapes and via candidates"]
  P --> N["Free space, NavMesh, corridors, physical resources"]
  P --> M["Indexed physical map: exact primitives, owners, layers, radii"]
  M --> E["Terrain guidance when enabled: LittlePlanets height, flow, pressure"]
  N --> U["Optional USPED guidance and route alternatives"]
  E --> A["Route portfolios and topology candidates"]
  U --> A
  T --> A
  A --> G["Global allocation: PathFinder negotiation, layer and via choices"]
  G --> S["Capacity accounting and exact-qualified clearance shadows"]
  M --> S
  S -. new source path, not in benchmark binary .-> SC["Construct legal copper scaffold: direct route, bounded physical search, victim exchange"]
  SC --> SQ{"Whole-board quantized oracle feasible?"}
  SQ -->|Yes| V
  SQ -->|No| SM
  S --> O["Explicit packing obligations: capacity is not physical proof"]
  S --> C["Measured conflicts and attributed diagnoses"]
  O --> R["Regional windows and joint candidate preparation"]
  C --> R
  R --> L["Feasibility screening, lane order and lane positions"]
  L --> F["Configured realization: PH curves and tightening, or straight geometry"]
  F --> X["Eligible joint repair: XPBD; optional AVBD refinement if residual improves"]
  X --> Q["Assemble and quantize candidate copper; internal oracle"]
  Q --> V{"Materialization gate: complete legal native or straight scene, or validated fallback?"}
  V -->|Yes| B["Fit PH to cubic Béziers; materialize net-assigned curves, straight tracks and vias"]
  B --> D["Internal validation, connectivity and curves; benchmark KiCad DRC"]
  D --> Z{"All required checks pass?"}
  Z -->|Yes| OK["Accepted routed board"]
  V -->|No| H["Physical feedback: owner pairs, bounds, layer, rule and topology cause"]
  Z -->|No| H
  H --> R
  H --> G
  H --> T
  H --> E
  SM["State engine: short resumable actions, deadlines, deterministic selection"] -. schedules .-> G
  SM -. schedules .-> R
  SM -. schedules .-> X
  SM -. schedules .-> B
  P --> SP["One bounded speculative preparation worker; validate snapshot before reuse"]
  SP --> R
  G -. checkpoints .-> OBS["Telemetry, viewer, benchmark history"]
  R -. geometry and metrics .-> OBS
  D -. authoritative results .-> OBS
